  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/SacarCorchoAlcudiaDeVeoParqueSierraEspadan.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Este s&aacute;bado, el Parque natural de la Sierra Espad&aacute;n ha organizado en Alcudia de Veo la actividad La saca del corcho, dedicada a este material y al alcornocal, y que se ha iniciado desde el &aacute;rea recreativa de la fuente de San Pedro.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7879.jpg\" alt=\"img_7879\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7881.jpg\" alt=\"img_7881\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7883.jpg\" alt=\"img_7883\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7887.jpg\" alt=\"img_7887\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7888.jpg\" alt=\"img_7888\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7889.jpg\" alt=\"img_7889\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7890.jpg\" alt=\"img_7890\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7891.jpg\" alt=\"img_7891\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitattretadelsuroalcudia/img_7892.jpg\" alt=\"img_7892\" style=\"max-width:100%